You may download the dataset used in the case study from PhysioNet:

🔗 **Download Dataset:**  
https://physionet.org/content/mimic-iv-ext-cdm/1.1/

**Used features:**
- HPI — *History of Present Illness*
- PE — *Physical Examination*
- Diagnostic CSV files

